The files in this directory are Ghidra's RISC-V processor specification,
copied without modification from

  https://github.com/NationalSecurityAgency/ghidra
  tag Ghidra_11.4_build, commit aed1cf1c4e060af395af241f0e6027be783b9591
  path Ghidra/Processors/RISCV/data/languages/ (riscv.lp64d.slaspec and every .sinc)

Ghidra is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the license text is
in LICENSE next to this file. nocompiler embeds these files into the
nocompiler-arch crate and parses them at run time with nocompiler-sleigh to
decode and lift RISC-V for the toolkit (decompiler, CFG, diff). Nothing derived
from them enters a proof.
